OL,3,AIndian opposition leaders march to top
OL,4,Acourt to demand election chief resign
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition parties allege that under
OL,7,FChief Election Commissioner Gyanesh
OL,8,FKumar, India's voter rolls are being
OL,9,Fmanipulated to benefit Prime Minister
OL,10,FNarendra Modi's Bharatiya Janata Party
OL,11,F(BJP). Both the Election Commission and
OL,12,Fthe BJP have rejected the charge.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
